# --- Table ---
click @asset.new-scene
click @hier.add
type ui table
click @addnode.create
expect node:UITable.type == UITableNode
key shift+f
wait 5
annotate @node:UITable The table's area (empty: no columns yet)
annotate @window:inspector Selected row, sort column and order, header and row heights
